":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"A Blessed Life","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Nik Davidson"],"date":"2012-07-24","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/blessed-life-2012-07-24","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/blessed-life-2012-07-24#:~:text=The%20Fourth%20Legion%20is,Greenfield%20and%20River%27s%20Glen.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"A Blessed Life\" by Nik Davidson. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 24 Jul 2012."}},{"id":"blessed-life-2012-07-24-e9","era":null,"summary":"Brenalt, now crippled and leading a few dozen survivors, sees a necromancer directing the dead below.","participants":["brenalt","necromancer","undead"],"location":null,"importance":"major","page":"stories/blessed-life-2012-07-24","order":363,"story_date":"2012-07-24","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":28,"quote":"The necromancer was real, after all.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/blessed-life-2012-07-24#:~:text=The%20necromancer%20was%20real%2C%20after%20all.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"A Blessed Life","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Nik Davidson"],"date":"2012-07-24","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/blessed-life-2012-07-24","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/blessed-life-2012-07-24#:~:text=The%20necromancer%20was%20real%2C%20after%20all.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"A Blessed Life\" by Nik Davidson. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 24 Jul 2012."}},{"id":"blessed-life-2012-07-24-e10","era":null,"summary":"Brenalt screams at the heavens that he gave everything and will die fighting, honoring his promise.","participants":["brenalt","angel"],"location":null,"importance":"major","page":"stories/blessed-life-2012-07-24","order":363,"story_date":"2012-07-24","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":30,"quote":"I will die fighting. I will die honoring my promise to you.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/blessed-life-2012-07-24#:~:text=I%20will%20die%20fighting.,my%20promise%20to%20you.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"A Blessed Life","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Nik Davidson"],"date":"2012-07-24","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/blessed-life-2012-07-24","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/blessed-life-2012-07-24#:~:text=I%20will%20die%20fighting.,my%20promise%20to%20you.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"A Blessed Life\" by Nik Davidson. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 24 Jul 2012."}},{"id":"blessed-life-2012-07-24-e11","era":null,"summary":"Brenalt bows his head with the praying refugees and raises his staff for one last charge as the wind changes.","participants":["brenalt"],"location":null,"importance":"major","page":"stories/blessed-life-2012-07-24","order":363,"story_date":"2012-07-24","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":33,"quote":"He raised his staff toward the enemy, girding himself for one last charge.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/blessed-life-2012-07-24#:~:text=He%20raised%20his%20staff,for%20one%20last%20charge.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"A Blessed Life","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Nik Davidson"],"date":"2012-07-24","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/blessed-life-2012-07-24","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/blessed-life-2012-07-24#:~:text=He%20raised%20his%20staff,for%20one%20last%20charge.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"A Blessed Life\" by Nik Davidson. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 24 Jul 2012."}},{"id":"brenalt-e0","era":null,"summary":"Brenalt's company is overwhelmed by undead; his friends die.","participants":["brenalt","tomas","edrick","stanton","mattias"],"location":"shandalar","importance":"major","page":"wiki/brenalt","order":1326,"story_date":